    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "O'Connell Properties are delighted to bring to the market 52 Glendhu Road, Navan Road, Dublin 7. This is a well presented 3 bedroom, terraced family home with front garden and a sunny back garden. A fantastic location only c.1km to the Phoenix Park and c.6 Kms to the City Centre.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation extends to c.99 sq. meters and comprises on ground floor an entrance hall, large bright living room to the front of the house and a separate living room and kitchen to the rear, with a downstairs WC. Upstairs has three bright bedroom, 2 double, and 1 single bedrooms and large family bathroom.\r\n\r\nThis is a highly desirable mature residential location convenient to numerous City Centre bus routes and walking distance to the local train station and Luas station. The property is convenient to the Phoenix Park and close to shops, schools and transport links. There are also numerous social, sporting and recreational clubs/facilities in the local community and an excellent choice of national and secondary schools.\r\n\r\n\"Whilst every care has been taken in the preparation of these particulars, and they are believed to be correct, they are not warranted and intended purchasers/lessees should satisfy themselves as to the correctness of the information given\"."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Front living room: 3.78m X 3.48m with a feature fireplace\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining: 5.72m X 2.26m fully fitted kitchen\r\n\r\nBathroom 1: 1m X 1.59m with WC and WHB\r\n\r\nLiving room: 4.25m X 3.48m\r\n\r\nBedroom 1: 2.59m X 2.64m Single bedroom\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: 3.5m X 4.23m large double bedroom\r\n\r\nBedroom 3: 3.64m X 3m Large double bedroom\r\n\r\nBathroom: 2.29m X 2.2m with tiles walls, WC, WHB, and shower\r\n\r\nFloor Area: Approx 97 sqm"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Excellent choice of local national and secondary schools \r\nVibrant local community with many sporting and recreational clubs/facilities available in the local community\r\nFantastic and much sought after location close to Luas station, train station\r\nLocated close to the wonderful Phoenix Park and Dublin City Centre \r\nPotential to extend at the rear and convert the attic"
      },
      {
